13:["$","$L27",null,{"type":"multiple","children":[["$","$L28",null,{"title":"Is self-hosting free?","id":"is-self-hosting-free","children":["$","p",null,{"children":["Yes, for permitted use. Most of the monorepo is\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"FSL-1.1-Apache-2.0"}],": internal use, modification, and redistribution\nfor non-competing purposes are allowed. Metrics and remote persistent\nworkers are Business Source License modules: fine for an individual\ndeveloper's cache, but shared, production, or commercial use of those\nmodules needs Forge Enterprise or an intentionally\ninexpensive commercial license. Meaningful contributors may be\neligible for waivers; contact the maintainers before relying on one.\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/reference/oss-and-enterprise","children":"Open source and Enterprise"}]," works through which files\ncarry which licence and why nothing in the binary tells you; the operative\ntext is the ",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"https://forge.com/license","children":"license page"}],"."]}]}],["$","$L28",null,{"title":"What am I actually paying for when I self-host?","id":"what-am-i-actually-paying-for-when-i-self-host","children":["$","p",null,{"children":["Compute for the control plane (a few small VMs), CAS storage (the\ndominant cost in a healthy cluster), worker compute, and the engineer\nhours to run it all. Which of those dominates depends on your fleet and\nyour build, and the honest answer is that you will not know the shape of\nthe bill until you have run it for a quarter.\n",["$","$L6",null,{"href":"/reference/oss-and-enterprise","children":"Open source and Enterprise"}]," sets out what the\nmanaged Enterprise tier does instead of you."]}]}],["$","$L28",null,{"title":"Does the free version limit cache or team size?","id":"does-the-free-version-limit-cache-or-team-size","children":["$","p",null,{"children":"No. Nothing artificially limits cache size, action count,\nworker count, or team size: the self-hosted build is the same\ncodebase run in production, subject to each module's license, minus\nthe operational tooling and support the paid tiers add."}]}]]}]
